#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "World Damping Location"
msgstr "World Damping Location"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の移動量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 移動量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space movement.\n0 = movement fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)."
msgstr "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の移動量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 移動量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space movement.\n0 = movement fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "World Damping Rotation"
msgstr "World Damping Rotation"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の回転量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 回転量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space rotation.\n0 = rotation fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)."
msgstr "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の回転量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 回転量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space rotation.\n0 = rotation fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)."

